(7631286, 1236902, 248240, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RKT:</b></div><hr/><i> ...the huge beefy border/frame is too much for the super cute and adorable bunnies. They feel trapped by it. I''m almost mad at the border for taking attention away from the cutness of those delightful wee rabbits. More photograph, less chunky border. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry you feel that way about the border! I''ve always been taught that presentation is equally as important when entering a competition. I feel like framing adds that extra touch and finishes it off. But to each their own ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by RKT: ...the huge beefy border/frame is too much for the super cute and adorable bunnies. They feel trapped by it. I''m almost mad at the border for taking attention away from the cutness of those delightful wee rabbits. More photograph, less chunky border.   Sorry you feel that way about the border! I''ve always been taught that presentation is equally as important when entering a competition. I feel like framing adds that extra touch and finishes it off. But to each their own ;)', '2019-05-29 14:54:26.000000', NULL, 0),
